			"notes": "**Warning: Save Breaking Changes**\n\nIf you used the prior version of this mod on a world the new version will result in blocks/items being deleted and may cause world corruption. \n\n**Changes:**\nNew:\n- Grain piles - allow storing of grain outside while reducing the effects of decay. Piles can be stacked and emptied from the bottom and filled from the top.\n- Crampons - they negate slipping on ice\n- Curios support for crowns\n- Cold Sweat/Thermia support for worn items  \nFixes:\n- Patchouli book fixed so text is mostly not rendering off the page.\n- Sling fixes\n- Rope Bridge placement is better\n- Fishing net placement is better"
		},
